1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,726
Examiners give marks for the layout itself, so learn these four lines.

2
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:06,002
Name the statement.

3
00:00:06,002 --> 00:00:07,343
Prove the basis.

4
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:11,484
Assume it for k, and say the words inductive hypothesis.

5
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:15,338
Then prove it for k plus one, and write the conclusion.

